            "field_project_story_body": [
                {
                    "value": "<h2>Starting with the interface</h2>\r\nI started working on the user interface first. In its early form, the whole game consisted of a graphical user interface: there was no actual game world yet. The interface was where I began exploring what the game could be.\r\n\r\nThe concept of a Petri dish grew out of that beginning: a world shown inside a circle. It gave me a way to imagine a contained space for the game within an experience that had started entirely as GUI. Spaceplan was another strong influence as I worked through these ideas.",
                    "format": "full_html"
                }
            ]
        },
