            "field_project_story_body": [
                {
                    "value": "<h2>From a first click to a universe</h2>The opening I imagine is almost empty: a black screen, a point of light, and a first click that sets things in motion. The interface would reveal itself gradually as the player discovers what they can do.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the concept is a loop of creating, combining and discovering. Players would generate particles, bring ingredients together, unlock new possibilities and eventually automate familiar actions. The broader progression would move from particles towards atoms, elements and more complex structures, with stars forming part of that journey.\r\n\r\nI want the next discovery to matter as much as the next upgrade. A new element should open a question: what can I make with this, and what conditions would I need?",
                    "format": "full_html"
                }
            ]
        },
