            "field_project_story_body": [
                {
                    "value": "<h2>Learning through interaction</h2>The design notes explore a central playground of moving particles, alongside cards for inspecting and combining what the player has discovered. Clicking, selecting and connecting would give abstract ideas something visible and tangible.\r\n\r\nThe educational aim is to make the basics of particle physics and chemistry approachable through experimentation. The notes include simplified mechanics, open questions and ideas that still need scientific checking. Working out how to keep the game understandable while respecting its subject is part of the design work ahead.",
                    "format": "full_html"
                }
            ]
        },
