            "field_project_story_body": [
                {
                    "value": "<h2>An idea I have kept building on since 2019</h2>Since August 2019, I have been putting my thoughts into SMEP: gameplay possibilities, interface sketches, progression ideas and references that help me think through the experience. The document has become a place to collect those thoughts and return to them over time.\r\n\r\nThe scope of those notes is deliberately broad. Some ideas describe the opening moments; others imagine much later stages. They are a record of the project's development and possibilities, rather than a promise that every feature will appear in the finished game.",
                    "format": "full_html"
                }
            ]
        },
