            "field_project_story_body": [
                {
                    "value": "<h2>Why now feels like the right time</h2>I expect to have more spare time to devote to SMEP, and modern technologies make it easier to turn the ideas I have collected into something I can try, evaluate and improve.\r\n\r\nThat makes this feel like a good moment to return to the project with renewed focus. I want to bring those years of thinking into a playable experience, starting with the interactions that make discovery enjoyable and building from there.\r\n\r\nThis is the first article about SMEP in my portfolio: an introduction to the project, where it came from, and the direction I want to take it.",
